<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Oncology cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Oncology cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it lowered its near-term rating on American Oncology Resources to neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Ken Weakley said the action was &quot;strictly on price,&quot; noting shares had appreciated about 65 percent year-to-date and achieved his price objective.</p>
<p>-- Said long-term rating remains at accumulate, noting, &quot;I still have a very favorable long-term view on the stock.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-1/8 to 15-3/4.</p>
</text>
